# Column Classifiers & Section Layouts

Edit **`includes/layouts/layout_sections.php`** for which columns land where and
how detail pages arrange cards. No URLs or DB credentials in that file.

Each key (`analysis`, `epics`, `daq`, `grouped_analysis`) has:

| Key | Role |
|-----|------|
| `exclude` | Columns omitted from cards (PK, `last_updated`, comments…) |
| `classifier` | Ordered rules; first match wins; unmatched → `"Other"` |
| `featured` | Full-width section title(s); prefer an array; `null` for none |
| `layouts` | Named bands (`main`, optional `other`, …): rows of section titles (`null` = spacer). Featured titles must not also appear here. `unallocated` is reserved |
| `ignore_sections` | Omit from the unallocated band only (still show if featured/laid out) |
| `duplicate_into` | Optional (EPICS): also copy named columns into another section |

`featured` / `layouts` / `ignore_sections` strings must match classifier
`section` values exactly. Pages must call `render_unallocated_sections()`
(≤4 cards per row; hidden when empty).

## Classifier match modes

Wrappers call `classify_column_from_rules()`:

1. **`match` => `prefix`** — text before first `_` equals `key` (Grouped_Analysis).
2. **`match` => `regex`** — `preg_match` (Analysis, EPICS, DAQ). Order matters
   (e.g. `^fadc_tet$` before broader patterns). Prefer one pattern per line.

DAQ groupings stay labeled **suggested** until the schema owner confirms them.
